  "schema:description": "Run agents on your pod: a dashboard to orchestrate them, an editor for their SKILL.md brains, a forum for their record-of-work, a window manager to organise multi-agent operations. Pairs naturally with `jss start --idp --mcp` (and `--mongo` for indexing at scale).",
